{"availability":"available","full":"yyoaavv/Unplugged","name":"Unplugged","description":"Unplugged is a private, offline-first habit recovery tracker. Log daily check-ins, build streaks, earn achievements, track slip triggers with pattern insights, and use the urge-support panel with breathing and a 10-minute timer. Install it as an app. No accounts, no tracking, all data stays on your device. Try it live in your browser.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-08T12:23:42Z","updated":"2026-10-10T14:27:44Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://yyoaavv.github.io/Unplugged/","topics":[],"demo":"https://yyoaavv.github.io/Unplugged/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.420Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.420Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.420Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T15:06:27.420Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A private, offline-first tracker for breaking a habit. One honest check-in a day, with tools for the moments that are hard. Everything stays on your device: no accounts, no servers, no analytics."],"features":["Daily check-in: log each day as clean or slipped, fix past days from the calendar, or fill in a whole range at once.","Slip journal: when you log a slip, an optional 2-second survey asks about the trigger (Stress, Boredom, Fatigue, Loneliness, Late at night, Peer pressure, Low mood), where you were, and when. Skip it any time, or add…","Pattern insights: the Stats tab turns your tags into plain-language insights, such as your most common trigger, setting and time of day.","Urge wins: tap \"I rode out an urge\" (on the Tracker tab or from the help panel) to log urges you felt and didn't act on. Wins show up in Stats and unlock achievements.","Urge strength: optionally rate an urge from 1 to 10 when it hits and again after you ride it out. Stats shows how much your urges fade on average."],"sourceUrl":